--------------------------------------------------------------------------
FairGrad reference solvers
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Short portions follow the official code of "Fair Resource Allocation in
Multi-Task Learning", Ban & Ji, ICML 2024:
  experiments/metaworld_ppo/mtrl/gradients/fairgrad.py and
  experiments/sac_baselines_ars/fairgrad_host.py
      the scipy least_squares fallback on the KKT residual
      G x - x^(-1/alpha), as in methods/weight_methods.py (fairgrad);
  experiments/metaworld_ppo/benchmarks/solver/selected_regimes_a1.py
      ports of that scipy reference and of the SGD + momentum solver in
      mtrl_files/fairgrad.py, used only as benchmark baselines.
The y-space Newton solver and the rest of these files are ours.
  Upstream: https://github.com/OptMN-Lab/fairgrad (commit b58bce8)
  License:  MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 OptMN-Lab

