experiments/metaworld_ppo/mtrl/algos/multitask_ppo.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
tianshou is the RL framework the PPO stack builds on (installed as a
dependency, not redistributed), and MultiTaskPPO subclasses its PPO. The
clipped-surrogate, dual-clip and value-clip loss code (in _update_with_batch,
_compute_per_task_actor_terms and _compute_value_loss) is adapted from
tianshou 2.0.0, tianshou/algorithm/modelfree/ppo.py.
  Upstream: https://github.com/thu-ml/tianshou
  License:  MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 Tianshou contributors

